{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/ajito_doku_010.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/ajito_doku_010.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_01",
      "hash64": "FE3FE6E5CC9BDE5B",
      "text": "……你能不能快点回去？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_01",
      "hash64": "8FC7CE649BB09D04",
      "text": "就不回去！\\n我想见毒帮班的老大秋明！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_02",
      "hash64": "FE3FE7E5CC9BE00E",
      "text": "所以啊，他本人都和我说了！\\n除了队员，任何人都不许放进来！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_02",
      "hash64": "8FC7D1649BB0A21D",
      "text": "我一定要见他！\\n我有话要和秋明说！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "FE3FE8E5CC9BE1C1",
      "text": "你快饶了我吧……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_system_01",
      "hash64": "C90A82F2B8B9430C",
      "text": "好像有人在争执。\\n……怎么办？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D6C26E8EEA4346BF",
      "text": "搭话",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D6C26F8EEA434872",
      "text": "走近看看",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_03",
      "hash64": "8FC7D0649BB0A06A",
      "text": "咦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "FE3FE9E5CC9BE374",
      "text": "啊～又来了一个。[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "FE3FEAE5CC9BE527",
      "text": "当天星队的新人\\n怎么这么麻烦……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_04",
      "hash64": "8FC7CB649BB097EB",
      "text": "……等等，这位手下！\\n这个人不是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "FE3FEBE5CC9BE6DA",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]……\\n就是那个向我们挑衅的家伙？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "D6C2708EEA434A25",
      "text": "没错",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "D6C2698EEA433E40",
      "text": "我来踢场的",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_05",
      "hash64": "8FC7CA649BB09638",
      "text": "……果然没错！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "FE3FECE5CC9BE88D",
      "text": "哇～不妙～！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "FE3FDDE5CC9BCF10",
      "text": "基地里的那帮人昨天整夜玩游戏，\\n现在一定还在睡觉……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_06",
      "hash64": "8FC7CD649BB09B51",
      "text": "……这里就交给我了！\\n这位手下，你去叫醒伙伴吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "FE3FDEE5CC9BD0C3",
      "text": "啊？为什么你要这么做？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_07",
      "hash64": "8FC7CC649BB0999E",
      "text": "基地要是不设防的话，\\n秋明岂不是也很危险？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_08",
      "hash64": "8FC7C7649BB0911F",
      "text": "秋明既是我的恩人，\\n又是我的同胞……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_09",
      "hash64": "8FC7C6649BB08F6C",
      "text": "即使要排除万难，我也要火速\\n前去解围，这是理所当然的！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "FE42EBE5CC9E1CB1",
      "text": "虽然我不明白你在说什么，\\n但你帮了我一个大忙！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_10",
      "hash64": "8FC449649BAD852E",
      "text": "盯上我同胞的奸诈之徒，\\n让我来做你的对手！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_05",
      "hash64": "D6C26A8EEA433FF3",
      "text": "好吧",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_06",
      "hash64": "D6C26B8EEA4341A6",
      "text": "等一下！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_11",
      "hash64": "8FC44A649BAD86E1",
      "text": "君子不立危墙之下，\\n这是个很聪明的判断啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_12",
      "hash64": "8FC447649BAD81C8",
      "text": "喝呀～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_13",
      "hash64": "8FC448649BAD837B",
      "text": "秋明……我对不起你……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "5F2032885202D340",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你没事吧？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "5F2035885202D859",
      "text": "我刚才一直在监视基地，\\n突然间这里就闹得沸沸扬扬的。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "5F2034885202D6A6",
      "text": "所以我很好奇这里发生了什么，\\n于是就来了……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_14",
      "hash64": "8FC44D649BAD8BFA",
      "text": "哎呀……！\\n居然来了个生力军……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "5F2037885202DBBF",
      "text": "他是……我们学校的学生？\\n似乎不像是天星队的人……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_15",
      "hash64": "8FC44E649BAD8DAD",
      "text": "我不是天星队的人……\\n但秋明是我的同胞！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_16",
      "hash64": "8FC44B649BAD8894",
      "text": "我无论如何都要见他！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "5F2036885202DA0C",
      "text": "……看来是事出有因啊。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "5F2039885202DF25",
      "text": "我来问问他吧。\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，基地就先交给你了。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "5F2038885202DD72",
      "text": "好了，我们走吧。\\n放心，我不会让你吃亏的。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
